# ============================
# Project Manager — .dockerignore
# ============================
# NOTE: Docker matches against context-root-relative paths with Go's
# filepath.Match (no gitignore recursion for slashless names), so patterns
# MUST use **/ to exclude nested node_modules/dist/data at any level.
**/node_modules/
npm-debug.log
**/dist/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo
**/data/
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.key
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
